  "body": "MSC3244 proposes adding a `room_capabilities` key to the response to [`/capabilities`](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.2/client-server-api/#get_matrixclientv3capabilities).\r\n\r\nDuring development, `org.matrix.msc3244.room_capabilities` is to be used as an unstable placeholder.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, Synapse exposes this key *by default*, even in stable environments. We should disable this.\r\n\r\n",
